            <gmd:abstract>
                <gco:CharacterString>&lt;!-- Release notes generated using configuration in .github/release.yml at main --&gt;

What's Changed



Add config file to filter bot PRs from release notes by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/266

MJO: mjo_phase_background by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/270

Array: fspan and ispan by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/276

Fourier Analysis: cfftf by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/278

Fourier Analysis: cfftb by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/282

Attribute automated deploy commits to github-actions bot by @anissa111 in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/287

7-Day Dependabot Cooldown by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/296

Set linkcheck as optional in PR by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/297

Add third level headers to contents menu by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/298

File I/O: addfile by @cyschneck in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/292

ITables NCL Index by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/210

Drop custom CSS by @kafitzgerald in https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/pull/301


Full Changelog: https://github.com/NCAR/geocat-applications/compare/v2026.01.0...v2026.05.0</gco:CharacterString>
